cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code in academic work, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "MADRL Drone Swarm: multi-agent deep reinforcement learning for X500 quadrotor swarms"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of a final-year engineering project (PFA) on multi-agent
  deep reinforcement learning for quadrotor swarm navigation. It combines an X500
  Gazebo Sim / ROS 2 Humble simulation setup, classical baselines (LiDAR-supervised
  square trajectory without odometry, PX4 SITL offboard control) and a
  Gymnasium-compatible swarm environment with PPO, SAC and MAPPO training scripts
  sharing one observation/action contract.
